      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091413">SSE4_1</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091415">Compare packed unsigned dword integers in xmm1 and xmm2/m128 and store packed minimum values in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1091417">VEX.128.66.0F38.WIG 3B /r</para>
